The regex replacement does not account for string literals or comments. If a string literal contains text like "Objects.requireNonNull" or "TimeUnit.SECONDS", the replacement will incorrectly modify it. Consider adding logic to skip replacements inside string literals (single and double quotes) and comments (line comments and block comments), or document this as a known limitation.
